1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,244
听：Computers.

2
00:00:01,244 --> 00:00:02,488
跟读：Computers.

3
00:00:02,488 --> 00:00:24,319
听：The goal of early calculating machines was to simplify difficult sums. But with the help of new technology, electronic chips replaced tubes and a revolution of artificial intelligence has arisen. From then on, the appearance of computers totally changed our lives.

4
00:00:24,319 --> 00:00:46,149
跟读：The goal of early calculating machines was to simplify difficult sums. But with the help of new technology, electronic chips replaced tubes and a revolution of artificial intelligence has arisen. From then on, the appearance of computers totally changed our lives.

5
00:00:46,149 --> 00:01:16,777
听：They can not only download information from the web when connected by the network or mobile phone signals, but also solve different types of logical problems. With operators as their coaches, they can even control rockets to explore the moon and instruct androids with the human race’s characters to mop floors and watch over your naughty niece. Anyhow, computers are so helpful that they do bring happiness.

6
